html:
{%- set d = letter_data(doc.name) -%}
<style>
  .sl { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: #1f2937; }
  .sl p { margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .sl .date { text-align: right; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .sl table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 14px 0 18px; }
  .sl th, .sl td { border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 7px 10px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
  .sl th { background: #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600; width: 42%; color: #1f2937 !important; font-size: 13px; }
  .sl thead th { background: #1f4e79; color: #fff !important; }
  .sl .missing { color: #b42318; font-style: italic; }
</style>
<div class="sl">
  <div class="date">{{ frappe.utils.formatdate(frappe.utils.nowdate(), "d MMMM yyyy") }}</div>
  <p>To our valued suppliers,</p>
  <p><b>Subject: Details for issuing UAE e-invoices to {{ d.company }}</b></p>
  <p>Under the UAE Electronic Invoicing System introduced by the Ministry of Finance, invoices
  between businesses are exchanged as structured electronic (XML) documents over the Peppol
  network through an Accredited Service Provider. This applies to the invoices you issue to us.</p>
  {%- if d.phase or d.go_live %}
  <p>{{ d.company }} falls under {{ d.phase or "the UAE e-invoicing rollout" }}{% if d.go_live %}, and we plan to go live
  from {{ frappe.utils.formatdate(d.go_live, "d MMMM yyyy") }}{% endif %}.</p>
  {%- endif %}
  <p>Please use the details below on every e-invoice you issue to us:</p>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Data Field</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {%- for label, value in d.rows %}
      <tr><th>{{ label }}</th><td>{% if value %}{{ value }}{% else %}<span class="missing">not set</span>{% endif %}</td></tr>
    {%- endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {%- if d.email %}
  <p>If you have any questions, or need help before you start sending us e-invoices, please write to
  <b>{{ d.email }}</b>.</p>
  {%- endif %}
  <p>Thank you for your cooperation.</p>
  <p>Yours faithfully,<br><b>{{ d.company }}</b></p>
</div>
